        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia Urban Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia Urban Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset is perfect for modern homes. This stainless steel front door handle has a resilient brushed stainless steel finish. The Urban Handleset is a dummy function, which means it doesn't lock or latch. Just for looks, the Urban Dummy Handleset is often used in conjunction with the <a href=\"/products/omnia-urban-single-cylinder-stainless-steel-handleset\">Urban Single Cylinder Handleset</a> on the inactive side of a pair of French doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Full Dummy Handlesets:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Matching <a href=\"/products/omnia-urban-single-cylinder-stainless-steel-handleset\"><b>Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a> for the active locking door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for the Omnia Urban Stainless Steel Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Function: Dummy Pair (outside and inside trim)</li>\r\n<li>Surface Mounted</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-3⁄8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Mount Length: 2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
