                "description": "The Omnia Urban Dummy Stainless Steel Handleset is perfect for modern homes. This stainless steel front door handle has a resilient brushed stainless steel finish. The Urban Handleset is a dummy function, which means it doesn't lock or latch. Just for looks, the Urban Dummy Handleset is often used in conjunction with the Urban Single Cylinder Handleset on the inactive side of a pair of French doors. \r\n",
